iu bang eventually won the war  and became emperor  this is obviously only a handful of the  named and exotic items out there but way  back when i originally wrote the script  i ended up abandoning it because i  thought it was something i was more  interested in than anyone else would be  plus i was starting to run the risk of  becoming a history channel with the way  it was going  but i recently opened it up again and  had read through and i still think it's  pretty cool i also love seeing the  nerdiness of some of the divs coming out  in these two  it's been a while since i've looked into  any of this so i may have a poke around  to see if there are any other items with  historical references that are worth  talking about  otherwise thank you very much for  watching and i'll catch in the next one  cheers  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

